Softbox is an easy-to-use picture and video sorting and cleaning tool.

===== Softbox Features =====

- Add portrait matting, save to album with one key;

- Quick classification of components;

- Identify photo QR code;

-Tag each photo to make searching easier;

-Clear local similar photos, leaving only the best moments;

-Filter all thumbnails, you can customize the thumbnail size;

-Album top function, put your favorite album in the most prominent position;

-Delete photos in batches with ease and effort;

-Quickly and conveniently organize photos in batches;

-Export photos in batches, you can customize the size of the exported pictures;

-One-click collection of favorite photos;

-Album rename and album delete functions are waiting for you!
